+++ b/.github/workflows/release.yml
@@ -15,6 +15,10 @@
 # and flatpak follow Linux; publish waits for all seven with !cancelled(),
 # puts every asset that was built on the release page and names any
 # platform whose build failed, so one broken package never withholds the rest.
+# Docs site (#688): `site` builds the Zola site in site/ from the same tree
+# alongside the platform builds; `pages` deploys it to GitHub Pages only on
+# a tag run and only once `publish` has put the release page up, so the
